sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS is able to request a new firmware update<br>when there is a transaction ongoing on the Charging Station
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EnergyTransferStarted

    CSMS->>CS: UpdateFirmwareRequest (firmware.signingCertificate)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: firmware.signingCertificate must be the configured signingCertificate
    CS-->>CSMS: UpdateFirmwareResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = DownloadScheduled)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 5: state change of all connectors that don't have a running transaction
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Unavailable) / NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Unavailable, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse (CSMS responds accordingly)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Wait for the configured transaction duration before executing the next step
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State StopAuthorized
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPostSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected

    Note over CS: Executed after the retrieveDateTime given in step 1 has been reached
    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Downloading)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Downloaded)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = SignatureVerified)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Installing)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = InstallRebooting)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = FirmwareUpdate)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (listed in header under Step 19): BootNotificationResponse status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 22: current state of all connectors
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available) / NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Available, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse (CSMS responds accordingly)

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Installed)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse
